    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>“The first thing worth defending was a circle of people who had decided, against all sense, to defend each other.”</em></p><p><strong>Coalition Tongue (1/Short Rest; recharges on Soma Break).</strong> As a bonus action, choose one ally within 30 feet who can hear and understand you. Their next attack roll, skill check, or defense check before the start of your next turn is made at +1 rank (to a maximum of rank 5). The fiction matters: name the thing you said, even if it was wordless.</p><p><strong>Symbolic Memory.</strong> You can read intent from a place. After spending 10 minutes in any inhabited or formerly-inhabited space, you may ask the GM one of: <em>Who lived here? What did they fear? What did they leave?</em> The answer is at least one truth, even if the GM colours it.</p>",
